// 23.26 (gen_oracle.py --check tns_bugs5): ALTER TABLE ... DROP COLUMN of a table views read (dropped; a view that used the column INVALID,
// ORA-04063 when read, its error in USER_ERRORS; one that did not VALID; a SELECT * view; a view over such a view; a view reading the table
// through GRAPH_TABLE). Each statement runs with set lexdb_batch = off (the row engine) and on: "same" and the answer, or DIFFERENT and both.
