// expect: same: NAME,TYPE,LINE,POSITION,TEXT,NL = 'DGV2'|'VIEW'|0|0|'ORA-04045: errors during recompilation or revalidation of APP.DGG2'|67;'DGV2'|'VIEW'|0|0|'ORA-00904: "AGE2": invalid identifier'|38
// expect: same: OKF(1) = 2
// expect: same: 5+OKF(3) = 9
// expect: same: OKF(1)+OKF(2),OKF(-1),OKF('1'),OKF(NULL),OKF(1.5) = 5|0|2|NULL|2.5
// expect: same: OKF(ID) = 2;NULL
// expect: same: X,APP.OKF(2) = 2|3
